<!doctype lake><title>🐳 𝓓𝓮𝓮𝓹𝓢𝓮𝓮𝓴</title><meta name="doc-version" content="1" /><meta name="viewport" content="adapt" /><meta name="typography" content="classic" /><meta name="paragraphSpacing" content="relax" /><meta name="defaultFontsize" content="16" /><h1 data-lake-id="n1rzY" id="n1rzY" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="uce39d8bd" id="uce39d8bd">🐺</span><span data-lake-id="uaf49c129" id="uaf49c129"> </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u4da3097a" id="u4da3097a">𝐃𝐞𝐞𝐩𝐒𝐞𝐞𝐤𝐌𝐨𝐄: 𝐓𝐨𝐰𝐚𝐫𝐝𝐬 𝐔𝐥𝐭𝐢𝐦𝐚𝐭𝐞 𝐄𝐱𝐩𝐞𝐫𝐭 𝐒𝐩𝐞𝐜𝐢𝐚𝐥𝐢𝐳𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧 𝐢𝐧 𝐌𝐢𝐱𝐭𝐮𝐫𝐞-𝐨𝐟-𝐄𝐱𝐩𝐞𝐫𝐭𝐬 𝐋𝐚𝐧𝐠𝐮𝐚𝐠𝐞 𝐌𝐨𝐝𝐞𝐥𝐬</span></strong></h1><p data-lake-id="u89140516" id="u89140516"><strong><span data-lake-id="uf5fc717a" id="uf5fc717a">近期研究与实践已通过实证表明，在训练数据充足的条件下，通过增加参数量和计算预算来扩展语言模型规模，可以显著提升模型能力</span></strong></p><ul list="udd83b8b1"><li fid="u5cbbeb76" data-lake-id="u0b176b65" id="u0b176b65"><span data-lake-id="ucba29f62" id="ucba29f62">将模型扩展至极大规模也会带来极高的计算成本。考虑到这一高昂成本，</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u5828b5cb" id="u5828b5cb" style="color: #004347">混合专家架构</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ucc565928" id="ucc565928">已成为一种广受关注的解决方案。该架构能够在扩展参数规模的同时，将计算成本维持在较低水平</span></li><li fid="u5cbbeb76" data-lake-id="ub027ee4f" id="ub027ee4f"><span data-lake-id="ubcad2998" id="ubcad2998">近年来，将 MoE 架构应用于 Transformer 的研究已成功将语言模型扩展至较大规模，并取得显著的性能表现。这些成果凸显 MoE 语言模型的巨大潜力与发展前景</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u8e02bc72" id="u8e02bc72"><strong><span data-lake-id="u185015e0" id="u185015e0">尽管 MoE 架构展现出良好的潜力，现有架构仍可能存在知识混杂与知识冗余问题，限制专家的专业化，即每个专家掌握互不重叠且具有明确侧重的知识。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u5ac93b67" id="u5ac93b67">传统 MoE 架构使用 MoE 层替换 Transformer 中的前馈网络。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="uae55f0b8" id="uae55f0b8">每个 MoE 层包含多个专家，每个专家在结构上均与标准 FFN 相同，而每个 token 被分配给一个或两个专家。该架构存在两个潜在问题</span></strong></p><ul list="ud28a24a8"><li fid="u04d6309c" data-lake-id="u48625fb3" id="u48625fb3"><strong><span data-lake-id="u5b0d7194" id="u5b0d7194">知识混杂</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u6409dc15" id="u6409dc15">：现有 MoE 实践通常采用数量有限的专家，例如 8 个或 16 个，因此，分配给某个专家的 token 很可能涵盖多种不同的知识。由此，该专家会倾向于将差异较大的多类知识整合到自身参数中，而这些知识难以被同时利用</span></li><li fid="u04d6309c" data-lake-id="u6ed44ef5" id="u6ed44ef5"><strong><span data-lake-id="u11355412" id="u11355412">知识冗余</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u9cdc33b6" id="u9cdc33b6">：分配给不同专家的 token 可能需要共通知识。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ue801c4a8" id="ue801c4a8" style="color: #5C0036">因此，多个专家可能最终在各自的参数中学习到相同的共通知识，从而造成专家参数的冗余</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u0824a0a9" id="u0824a0a9">。这些问题共同阻碍现有 MoE 实践中的专家专业化，使其无法达到 MoE 模型理论上的性能上限</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ue26217c5" id="ue26217c5"><strong><span data-lake-id="u2e4343b7" id="u2e4343b7">针对上述问题，作者提出 DeepSeekMoE，一种旨在实现极致专家专业化的创新 MoE 架构。该架构包含两项主要策略</span></strong></p><ul list="uf99bc331"><li fid="ue4085b2d" data-lake-id="uc0ba4829" id="uc0ba4829"><strong><span data-lake-id="u28dd1a17" id="u28dd1a17">细粒度专家划分</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uf1e2f7fe" id="uf1e2f7fe">：</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u3c931547" id="u3c931547" style="color: #5C0036">在保持参数量不变的前提下，通过拆分 FFN 的中间隐藏维度，将专家划分为更细的粒度</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u75522dc7" id="u75522dc7">。相应地，在保持计算成本不变的条件下，激活更多细粒度专家，从而使被激活专家的组合更加灵活、适应性更强。细粒度专家划分使不同知识能够得到更细致的分解，并由不同专家更精确地学习，从而使每个专家保持更高的专业化水平。此外，被激活专家组合方式的灵活性提升，也有助于实现更准确、更有针对性的知识获取</span></li><li fid="ue4085b2d" data-lake-id="u1c3255ed" id="u1c3255ed"><strong><span data-lake-id="u93489569" id="u93489569">共享专家隔离</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u8e6e7b89" id="u8e6e7b89">：将部分专家单独划分为始终激活的共享专家，旨在捕获并整合不同上下文中的共通知识。通过将共通知识压缩到这些共享专家中，可以减少其余路由专家之间的冗余。这能够提高参数效率，并使每个路由专家通过专注于各自独特的方面而保持专业化</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u3cb5a503" id="u3cb5a503"><strong><span data-lake-id="u6f742b2e" id="u6f742b2e">作者首先从参数量为 2B 的较小规模出发，验证 DeepSeekMoE 架构的优势，并在涵盖不同任务的 12 个零样本或少样本基准上进行评估</span></strong></p><ul list="ub73331cc"><li fid="u2ac234fb" data-lake-id="u9bb44716" id="u9bb44716"><span data-lake-id="u72eff2e3" id="u72eff2e3">DeepSeekMoE 2B 显著优于 GShard 2B，甚至能够达到更大规模 MoE 模型 GShard 2.9B 的性能水平，而后者的专家参数量和计算量均为其 1.5 倍</span></li><li fid="u2ac234fb" data-lake-id="u2d265dcb" id="u2d265dcb"><span data-lake-id="udaa6079f" id="udaa6079f">值得关注的是，作者发现 DeepSeekMoE 2B 的性能已接近参数量相同的对应稠密模型，而后者构成 MoE 语言模型的严格性能上界</span></li><li fid="u2ac234fb" data-lake-id="ud5b82164" id="ud5b82164"><span data-lake-id="u724dbf24" id="u724dbf24">基于该架构，作者进一步将模型参数规模扩展至 16B，并在包含 2T token 的大规模语料上训练 DeepSeekMoE 16B。评估结果表明，DeepSeekMoE 16B 仅使用约 40% 的计算量，即可达到与 DeepSeek 7B 相当的性能，后者是在相同 2T token 语料上训练的稠密模型</span></li><li fid="u2ac234fb" data-lake-id="u1ac89d25" id="u1ac89d25"><span data-lake-id="ue3fb1cbb" id="ue3fb1cbb">作者还将 DeepSeekMoE 与开源模型进行比较。评估结果表明，DeepSeekMoE 16B 持续大幅优于激活参数量相近的模型，并取得与 LLaMA2 7B 相当的性能，而后者的激活参数量约为其 2.5 倍</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="G8no5" id="G8no5" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="ue32ec5ff" id="ue32ec5ff">🐗</span><span data-lake-id="u7a58e2cd" id="u7a58e2cd"> 𝐏𝐫𝐞𝐥𝐢𝐦𝐢𝐧𝐚𝐫𝐢𝐞𝐬: 𝐌𝐢𝐱𝐭𝐮𝐫𝐞-𝐨𝐟-𝐄𝐱𝐩𝐞𝐫𝐭𝐬 𝐟𝐨𝐫 𝐓𝐫𝐚𝐧𝐬𝐟𝐨𝐫𝐦𝐞𝐫𝐬</span></h2><p data-lake-id="ue1f548d7" id="ue1f548d7"><strong><span data-lake-id="uf01d04f6" id="uf01d04f6">标准 Transformer 语言模型由</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20L%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F97a65d824ef5766184877c3f711d3e69.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22tXqmO%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uaef4f35e" id="uaef4f35e">层标准 Transformer 块堆叠构成，其中每个块可表示为</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u16b65614" id="u16b65614" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bu%7D_%7B1%3AT%7D%5E%7Bl%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Coperatorname%7BSelf-Att%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bh%7D_%7B1%3AT%7D%5E%7Bl-1%7D%5C%5Cright)%20%2B%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bh%7D_%7B1%3AT%7D%5E%7Bl-1%7D%2C%20%5C%5Ctag%7B1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb053c619c0a070af53a5b9c7597c421c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ewitD%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u7901c142" id="u7901c142" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bh%7D_%7Bt%7D%5E%7Bl%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Coperatorname%7BFFN%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bu%7D_%7Bt%7D%5E%7Bl%7D%5C%5Cright)%20%2B%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bu%7D_%7Bt%7D%5E%7Bl%7D%2C%20%5C%5Ctag%7B2%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F52f3920bf3de0cd93c1994a6c1e1299f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22AG3ue%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u8c0df2eb"><li fid="uabd7c765" data-lake-id="ude267119" id="ude267119"><span data-lake-id="u9144081b" id="u9144081b">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22T%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1553dae3cc5c15cddb4f5b5a367b0aba.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22F6ykP%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3f10c29f" id="u3f10c29f">表示序列长度，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coperatorname%7BSelf-Att%7D(%5C%5Ccdot)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9eb2f4f0f7be40424477661041869585.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vHm2s%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u931c88e6" id="u931c88e6">表示自注意力模块，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coperatorname%7BFFN%7D(%5C%5Ccdot)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0b8d0d7ec3ac9ebffa78499c9a225996.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22VrO0j%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u91ba9623" id="u91ba9623">表示前馈网络（FFN），</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bu%7D_%7B1%3AT%7D%5E%7Bl%7D%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7BT%20%5C%5Ctimes%20d%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F847aa8c477badbf37de779e7b24befe6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YRqX8%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4febc50a" id="u4febc50a">是所有 token 经过第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20l%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2086b3e9a86ae9cf4579cb1fa00957f2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22DYsJT%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uaa404793" id="uaa404793">层注意力模块后的隐藏状态，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bh%7D_%7Bt%7D%5E%7Bl%7D%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bd%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdd2e9563a1ea511c1f45231c66c7e300.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22h2cRu%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u876bc726" id="u876bc726">是第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcead1760d9d5723460c4b8d4028f113a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uAGjR%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u44f3909c" id="u44f3909c">个 token 经过第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20l%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2086b3e9a86ae9cf4579cb1fa00957f2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zFrCB%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3543638d" id="u3543638d">个 Transformer 块后的输出隐藏状态</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u0a98f64e" id="u0a98f64e"><strong><span data-lake-id="ud8d611d2" id="ud8d611d2">构建 MoE 语言模型的常见做法是，按指定间隔将 Transformer 中的 FFN 替换为 MoE 层。一个 MoE 层由多个专家组成，其中每个专家在结构上均与标准 FFN 相同。随后，每个 token 被分配给一个或两个专家。如果第</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22l%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6945e109777fe3fd777e8254f0ec0f0c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uJH8A%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u35a09d8a" id="u35a09d8a">层 FFN 被替换为 MoE 层，则其输出隐藏状态</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bh%7D_%7Bt%7D%5E%7Bl%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6f01565cda3c994e4a4f808e7717d7c4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22tQtMX%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u4b361598" id="u4b361598">的计算表示为</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="ue4f05c39" id="ue4f05c39" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bh%7D_%7Bt%7D%5E%7Bl%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BN%7D%20%5C%5Cleft(g_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5C%5Coperatorname%7BFFN%7D_%7Bi%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bu%7D_%7Bt%7D%5E%7Bl%7D%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cright)%20%2B%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bu%7D_%7Bt%7D%5E%7Bl%7D%2C%20%5C%5Ctag%7B3%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F637f67b8acb4f8dbffc17099788ff9ee.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22EFv7o%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u81029fdc" id="u81029fdc" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22g_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cbegin%7Bcases%7D%20s_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%2C%20%26%20s_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Coperatorname%7BTopk%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cleft%5C%5C%7Bs_%7Bj%2Ct%7D%20%5C%5Cmid%201%20%5C%5Cleq%20j%20%5C%5Cleq%20N%5C%5Cright%5C%5C%7D%2C%20K%5C%5Cright)%2C%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%200%2C%20%26%20%5C%5Ctext%7Botherwise%7D%2C%20%5C%5Cend%7Bcases%7D%20%5C%5Ctag%7B4%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4f521b54c255c961cedf0ffbe323a2c5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22FdmdZ%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ub604f0bb" id="ub604f0bb" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Coperatorname%7BSoftmax%7D_%7Bi%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bu%7D_%7Bt%7D%5E%7BlT%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Be%7D_%7Bi%7D%5E%7Bl%7D%5C%5Cright)%2C%20%5C%5Ctag%7B5%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F954febfd6c1ae989e10809ce21fc6930.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22H6djy%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u370cf7ed"><li fid="u7a734778" data-lake-id="u315dd0d8" id="u315dd0d8"><span data-lake-id="u90e6bbee" id="u90e6bbee">​</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22N%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F459f3c80a50b7be28751b0869ef5386a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22tUAQ2%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ueca010b0" id="ueca010b0">表示专家总数，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coperatorname%7BFFN%7D_%7Bi%7D(%5C%5Ccdot)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F05979e6069a3d6bd13972621c9337d96.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wt65i%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u28291d3a" id="u28291d3a">是第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20i%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5c6f609fb47bb3cfc121433cb2de7a84.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22kVG3H%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua00f4048" id="ua00f4048">个专家的 FFN，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22g_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F833ee9318bf92b409adb9bd06a8bac13.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zdQ88%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua5ac69de" id="ua5ac69de">表示第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20i%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5c6f609fb47bb3cfc121433cb2de7a84.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22AEHuD%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6ad7939f" id="u6ad7939f">个专家的门控值，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F116f6488912de5138070e9f2058d091d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zrOhG%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2539a56f" id="u2539a56f">表示 token 与专家之间的亲和度，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coperatorname%7BTopk%7D(%5C%5Ccdot%2C%20K)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F309a9068640ab746b9af4dc3e93071ab.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22XJ4Dm%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5928287c" id="u5928287c">表示由第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd99979941e2b40b5ffd75f89c83e37b4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22X1QLm%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud146e805" id="ud146e805">个 token 与所有</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20N%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F472c93d29dce3da21900c71604613d75.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22eacUd%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3e2835ad" id="u3e2835ad">个专家之间计算得到的亲和度得分中最高的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20K%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2a44da316da48b0ab8fd154f1f9108c8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22edllw%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u86a6e35e" id="u86a6e35e">个得分所构成的集合，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Be%7D_%7Bi%7D%5E%7Bl%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe684015cfa4504b9aea3c249fdfd581a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22fH7l2%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6018cb81" id="u6018cb81">是第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20l%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2086b3e9a86ae9cf4579cb1fa00957f2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22biQGw%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u17f9bb0e" id="u17f9bb0e">层中第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20i%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5c6f609fb47bb3cfc121433cb2de7a84.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22eSH9j%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u44084734" id="u44084734">个专家的质心</span></li><li fid="u7a734778" data-lake-id="u464ec801" id="u464ec801"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22g_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F833ee9318bf92b409adb9bd06a8bac13.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22MEQkN%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0d85e7b9" id="u0d85e7b9">是稀疏的，即</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20N%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F472c93d29dce3da21900c71604613d75.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22l7RWj%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9eba3bc6" id="u9eba3bc6">个门控值中仅有</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20K%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2a44da316da48b0ab8fd154f1f9108c8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22X6ZB9%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud7c087fe" id="ud7c087fe">个非零值。这种稀疏性保证 MoE 层内的计算效率，即每个 token 仅被分配给</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20K%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2a44da316da48b0ab8fd154f1f9108c8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22e9tyM%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud476b4b0" id="ud476b4b0">个专家，并仅在这</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22K%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F38a3f4d664b7a723d138f9d57be0c783.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22kusnO%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uee5f7030" id="uee5f7030">个专家中进行计算</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u0e1074a8" id="u0e1074a8" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1790601418301-31aee22c-9869-4c5f-8d5a-36fb608a1c5f.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u06cd1294-68e3-45c1-84de-69ce770d8c3%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u29fb42ae-844d-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A753%2C%22height%22%3A388%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A484128%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1516%2C%22originHeight%22%3A781%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%88%98%22%2C%22x%22%3A408%2C%22y%22%3A338%2C%22width%22%3A1013%2C%22height%22%3A83%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22(B)%2BFINE-GRAINEDEXPERTSEGMENTATION%22%2C%22x%22%3A502%2C%22y%22%3A702%2C%22width%22%3A504%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22(A)CONVENTIONALTOP-2ROUTING%22%2C%22x%22%3A29%2C%22y%22%3A700%2C%22width%22%3A375%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22(C)%2BSHAREDEXPERTLSOLATION%22%2C%22x%22%3A1065%2C%22y%22%3A700%2C%22width%22%3A345%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OUTPUTHIDDENOO%22%2C%22x%22%3A1042%2C%22y%22%3A191%2C%22width%22%3A255%2C%22height%22%3A36%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SHAREDEXPERT%22%2C%22x%22%3A1331%2C%22y%22%3A115%2C%22width%22%3A166%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DEEPSEEKMOE)%22%2C%22x%22%3A1121%2C%22y%22%3A735%2C%22width%22%3A230%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22NPUTHIDDEN%22%2C%22x%22%3A1055%2C%22y%22%3A630%2C%22width%22%3A139%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ROUTEDEXPERT%22%2C%22x%22%3A1326%2C%22y%22%3A65%2C%22width%22%3A169%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OUTPUTHIDDEN%22%2C%22x%22%3A49%2C%22y%22%3A193%2C%22width%22%3A168%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OUTPUTHIDDEN%22%2C%22x%22%3A545%2C%22y%22%3A197%2C%22width%22%3A164%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22K%3D3%22%2C%22x%22%3A1307%2C%22y%22%3A551%2C%22width%22%3A145%2C%22height%22%3A38%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22NPUTHIDDEN%22%2C%22x%22%3A557%2C%22y%22%3A635%2C%22width%22%3A135%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22INPUTHIDDEN%22%2C%22x%22%3A44%2C%22y%22%3A626%2C%22width%22%3A168%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22GO%22%2C%22x%22%3A1204%2C%22y%22%3A613%2C%22width%22%3A83%2C%22height%22%3A49%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OO%22%2C%22x%22%3A191%2C%22y%22%3A615%2C%22width%22%3A101%2C%22height%22%3A43%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%A4%9A%E5%A4%9A%22%2C%22x%22%3A1152%2C%22y%22%3A314%2C%22width%22%3A238%2C%22height%22%3A43%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ROUTER%22%2C%22x%22%3A698%2C%22y%22%3A562%2C%22width%22%3A85%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ROUTER%22%2C%22x%22%3A216%2C%22y%22%3A559%2C%22width%22%3A78%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ROUTER%22%2C%22x%22%3A1208%2C%22y%22%3A562%2C%22width%22%3A79%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OO%22%2C%22x%22%3A689%2C%22y%22%3A627%2C%22width%22%3A87%2C%22height%22%3A33%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22K%3D%22%2C%22x%22%3A814%2C%22y%22%3A557%2C%22width%22%3A101%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22K%3D2%22%2C%22x%22%3A320%2C%22y%22%3A553%2C%22width%22%3A100%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f6f5ec%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u909d93f6%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><h2 data-lake-id="pRmSW" id="pRmSW" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="uf69f21bf" id="uf69f21bf">🌠</span><span data-lake-id="u81bb5359" id="u81bb5359"> 𝐃𝐞𝐞𝐩𝐒𝐞𝐞𝐤𝐌𝐨𝐄 𝐀𝐫𝐜𝐡𝐢𝐭𝐞𝐜𝐭𝐮𝐫𝐞</span></h2><p data-lake-id="uf8a6ea62" id="uf8a6ea62"><strong><span data-lake-id="udec5ff7b" id="udec5ff7b">在专家数量有限的情况下，分配给某个专家的 token 更可能涵盖多种类型的知识。因此，该专家会倾向于在其参数中学习差异很大的多类知识，而这些知识难以被同时利用。</span></strong><strong><span data-lake-id="u7a0f5d6d" id="u7a0f5d6d" style="color: #DF2A3F">然而，如果每个 token 能够被路由至更多专家，不同知识就有可能被分解，并分别由不同专家学习</span></strong><strong><span data-lake-id="ue004a35d" id="ue004a35d">。在这种情况下，每个专家仍可保持较高的专业化水平，从而使各专家的知识分布更有侧重</span></strong></p><ul list="u97b471e6"><li fid="uf4070a72" data-lake-id="u9c6383af" id="u9c6383af"><span data-lake-id="u89a06f3b" id="u89a06f3b">作者在保持专家参数量和计算成本不变的同时，对专家进行更细粒度的划分。更细粒度的专家划分使被激活专家的组合更加灵活、适应性更强</span></li><li fid="uf4070a72" data-lake-id="u034f8e5f" id="u034f8e5f"><span data-lake-id="u60089fbb" id="u60089fbb">通过将 FFN 的中间隐藏维度缩减至原来的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7Bm%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F37468e4c0b9aa3f7401a58b848fa5375.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22y7Gw3%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4c35b19f" id="u4c35b19f">，将每个专家 FFN 划分为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20m%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F01a0b33465cb6a9a84504f60af049255.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22p966t%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8712f389" id="u8712f389">个更小的专家。由于每个专家的规模变小，作者相应地将激活专家的数量增加至原来的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20m%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F01a0b33465cb6a9a84504f60af049255.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Fji89%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u40499141" id="u40499141">倍，以保持相同的计算成本</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u06af147f" id="u06af147f" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bh%7D_%7Bt%7D%5E%7Bl%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BmN%7D%20%5C%5Cleft(g_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5C%5Coperatorname%7BFFN%7D_%7Bi%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bu%7D_%7Bt%7D%5E%7Bl%7D%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cright)%20%2B%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bu%7D_%7Bt%7D%5E%7Bl%7D%2C%20%5C%5Ctag%7B6%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7646f10dec662c679392f5d4e065e6ae.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lO97P%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u011cac9e" id="u011cac9e" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22g_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cbegin%7Bcases%7D%20s_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%2C%20%26%20s_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Coperatorname%7BTopk%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cleft%5C%5C%7Bs_%7Bj%2Ct%7D%20%5C%5Cmid%201%20%5C%5Cleq%20j%20%5C%5Cleq%20mN%5C%5Cright%5C%5C%7D%2C%20mK%5C%5Cright)%2C%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%200%2C%20%26%20%5C%5Ctext%7Botherwise%7D%2C%20%5C%5Cend%7Bcases%7D%20%5C%5Ctag%7B7%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F110404427644b57bf7356573b540d1a6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Tqxtd%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u160d3e78" id="u160d3e78" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Coperatorname%7BSoftmax%7D_%7Bi%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bu%7D_%7Bt%7D%5E%7BlT%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Be%7D_%7Bi%7D%5E%7Bl%7D%5C%5Cright)%2C%20%5C%5Ctag%7B8%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fffdbc0ec938639858853db815c9a3a6e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22rzv6r%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u70a331c6" id="u70a331c6"><span data-lake-id="u2c8e13ca" id="u2c8e13ca">​</span><br></p><ul list="uf2b5c69a"><li fid="u028486d1" data-lake-id="u43501ef3" id="u43501ef3"><span data-lake-id="ufd5c6a32" id="ufd5c6a32">其中，专家参数总量等于标准 FFN 参数量的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20N%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F472c93d29dce3da21900c71604613d75.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zEyi7%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc6e6bfc2" id="uc6e6bfc2">倍，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22mN%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa1b04309ea93c64373ac51325beb215a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22DacEf%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0de67b60" id="u0de67b60">表示细粒度专家的总数。采用细粒度专家划分策略后，非零门控值的数量也增加至</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20mK%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F49f4ee326b64c7fdd30da5b162fde00a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22DUa23%22%7D"></card></li><li fid="u028486d1" data-lake-id="u36683db9" id="u36683db9"><span data-lake-id="udb86dcd9" id="udb86dcd9">从组合的角度来看，细粒度专家划分策略显著提高被激活专家的组合灵活性。考虑</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22N%20%3D%2016%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe0a1f6e1dcf55642a5aa86bf9e2721a6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22AImSN%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9e5fe5e9" id="u9e5fe5e9">的情况。典型的 top-2 路由策略可以产生</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbinom%7B16%7D%7B2%7D%20%3D%20120%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F52c6a5ec847563b6c21b0afd9193af2a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22RiKaM%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u91f82e2b" id="u91f82e2b">种可能的组合。相比之下，如果将每个专家划分为 4 个小专家，细粒度路由策略可以产</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbinom%7B64%7D%7B8%7D%20%3D%204%7B%2C%7D426%7B%2C%7D165%7B%2C%7D368%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9e0bddcdbbd26324a7eac88d4a08d54e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22teXRX%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1fa969a1" id="u1fa969a1">种潜在组合。组合灵活性的大幅提升，增强实现更准确、更有针对性的知识获取的潜力</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u4353c392" id="u4353c392"><strong><span data-lake-id="u4c1470c2" id="u4c1470c2">采用传统路由策略时，分配给不同专家的 token 可能需要某些共通的知识或信息。因此，多个专家可能最终在各自的参数中学习到相同的共享知识，从而造成专家参数冗余。然而，如果设置专门用于捕获和整合不同上下文中共通知识的共享专家，其他路由专家之间的参数冗余就会得到缓解。冗余的减少将有助于构建参数效率更高、专家更加专业化的模型</span></strong></p><ul list="uaaaa5e52"><li fid="u8a4f2e70" data-lake-id="ua1fa0864" id="ua1fa0864"><span data-lake-id="u76a81522" id="u76a81522">除细粒度专家划分策略外，作者进一步将</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22K_s%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F768d8fbf5b8122c21c31fafda0e505b8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zrr4Q%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2248d9e2" id="u2248d9e2">个专家单独划分为共享专家。无论路由模块如何，每个 token 都会确定性地被分配给这些共享专家。为保持计算成本不变，其余路由专家中被激活的专家数量将减少</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22K_s%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F768d8fbf5b8122c21c31fafda0e505b8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lYxFZ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u358e85a6" id="u358e85a6">。引入共享专家隔离策略后，完整 DeepSeekMoE 架构中的 MoE 层可表示为</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u6e8d2b4d" id="u6e8d2b4d" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bh%7D_%7Bt%7D%5E%7Bl%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BK_s%7D%20%5C%5Coperatorname%7BFFN%7D_%7Bi%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bu%7D_%7Bt%7D%5E%7Bl%7D%5C%5Cright)%20%2B%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3DK_s%2B1%7D%5E%7BmN%7D%20%5C%5Cleft(g_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5C%5Coperatorname%7BFFN%7D_%7Bi%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bu%7D_%7Bt%7D%5E%7Bl%7D%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cright)%20%2B%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bu%7D_%7Bt%7D%5E%7Bl%7D%2C%20%5C%5Ctag%7B9%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd675fb0357e5bf7c798ed7b0b1f24ef3.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22yA4c4%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u562c8cd6" id="u562c8cd6" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22g_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cbegin%7Bcases%7D%20s_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%2C%20%26%20s_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Coperatorname%7BTopk%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cleft%5C%5C%7Bs_%7Bj%2Ct%7D%20%5C%5Cmid%20K_s%20%2B%201%20%5C%5Cleq%20j%20%5C%5Cleq%20mN%5C%5Cright%5C%5C%7D%2C%20mK%20-%20K_s%5C%5Cright)%2C%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%200%2C%20%26%20%5C%5Ctext%7Botherwise%7D%2C%20%5C%5Cend%7Bcases%7D%20%5C%5Ctag%7B10%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ffcc86b3273b96ab430ce3553a0f6b613.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22EXkyI%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u533e5c33" id="u533e5c33" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Coperatorname%7BSoftmax%7D_%7Bi%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bu%7D_%7Bt%7D%5E%7BlT%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Be%7D_%7Bi%7D%5E%7Bl%7D%5C%5Cright).%20%5C%5Ctag%7B11%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4b8c250f88126958444648803ef4fb63.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22gxZkw%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="uc51d525b"><li fid="uc39984a4" data-lake-id="u0fb0d276" id="u0fb0d276"><span data-lake-id="ub41863b4" id="ub41863b4">在 DeepSeekMoE 中，共享专家的数量为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22K_s%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F768d8fbf5b8122c21c31fafda0e505b8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22waX8M%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub8be13a2" id="ub8be13a2">，路由专家的总数为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22mN%20-%20K_s%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc579f5380354543e430f457bf983ce5b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22N95Wd%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u79d29c12" id="u79d29c12">，非零门控值的数量为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22mK%20-%20K_s%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4678ff13feffe34d6d0fe453a3a22cf2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22AUb3D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6882089f" id="u6882089f">​</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ud35733db" id="ud35733db"><strong><span data-lake-id="u5df633ef" id="u5df633ef">自动学习得到的路由策略可能遇到负载不均衡问题，这一问题存在两个明显弊端。首先，存在路由坍塌的风险，即模型始终只选择少数专家，导致其他专家无法得到充分训练。其次，如果专家分布在多个设备上，负载不均衡可能加剧计算瓶颈</span></strong></p><ul list="uaec2eefc"><li fid="u1c16b9e6" data-lake-id="u45c94f50" id="u45c94f50"><strong><span data-lake-id="ue0d15d1c" id="ue0d15d1c">专家级均衡损失：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uf3b7a4d8" id="uf3b7a4d8">为降低路由坍塌的风险，作者还采用专家级均衡损失。该均衡损失的计算如下</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uaa22c12c" id="uaa22c12c" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BExpBal%7D%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Calpha_1%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BN'%7D%20f_i%20P_i%2C%20%5C%5Ctag%7B12%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd96c01bc8f3ef8ced48d5f8a4045e9f8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22IsOaO%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ue0f6bb48" id="ue0f6bb48" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f_i%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7BN'%7D%7BK'T%7D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5E%7BT%7D%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7B1%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Ctext%7BToken%20%7D%20t%20%5C%5Ctext%7B%20selects%20Expert%20%7D%20i%5C%5Cright)%2C%20%5C%5Ctag%7B13%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7d17533c0016391a50abf8e3f5671cf5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22naizl%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ue66565b5" id="ue66565b5" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P_i%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7BT%7D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5E%7BT%7D%20s_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%2C%20%5C%5Ctag%7B14%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa68cdf4078bb235dba19d62ebe2788b6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Mz355%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ufaff2a33"><li fid="u42fce1de" data-lake-id="u71b92b8b" id="u71b92b8b"><strong><span data-lake-id="uac03d0e7" id="uac03d0e7">设备级均衡损失：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u4dad7766" id="u4dad7766">除专家级均衡损失外，作者还引入设备级均衡损失。当目标是缓解计算瓶颈时，无须在专家层面施加严格的均衡约束，因为过度的负载均衡约束会损害模型性能。作者的主要目标是确保设备之间的计算均衡。如果将所有路由专家划分为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F558270b7f0a90c3c286b860273d106a0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22V14iF%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u60264e51" id="u60264e51">组 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5C%7B%5C%5Cmathcal%7BE%7D_1%2C%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BE%7D_2%2C%20%5C%5Cldots%2C%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BE%7D_D%5C%5C%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F530e0038f6bfe6bbb89f01b44a90e55e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22RD7Vo%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u064c7da5" id="u064c7da5">，并将每组部署在一个设备上，则设备级均衡损失的计算如下</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u9b5f1250" id="u9b5f1250" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BDevBal%7D%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Calpha_2%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BD%7D%20f_i'%20P_i'%2C%20%5C%5Ctag%7B15%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F836ce01c34caa6a8ae476077c9a60c0e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22svzGt%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u29ae454c" id="u29ae454c" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f_i'%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%7C%5C%5Cmathcal%7BE%7D_i%7C%7D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bj%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BE%7D_i%7D%20f_j%2C%20%5C%5Ctag%7B16%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6fae84c8ef6cf0f1130c124a09307a56.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lBp3P%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ude25177d" id="ude25177d" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P_i'%20%3D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bj%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BE%7D_i%7D%20P_j%2C%20%5C%5Ctag%7B17%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc615c9910f1d5ab782d5d60e8d2ef502.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22qttuK%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ucdff55f6"><li fid="ud33be319" data-lake-id="u1d5d4982" id="u1d5d4982"><span data-lake-id="u61e44b52" id="u61e44b52">在实践中，作者设置较小的专家级均衡因子，以降低路由坍塌的风险，同时设置较大的设备级均衡因子，以促进设备之间的计算均衡</span></li></ul>